SUMMARY:'Quin Chat: Modern Parenting - Navigating Teen Mental Health Togeth
 er
LOCATION:Scottie's
DESCRIPTION:Category: Health & Wellness\nPrice: Free\nAvailability: 58 spot
 s left\nStatus: Available\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/eve
 nts/206905\n\n7:00PM Reception\, 7:30PM Discussion\n\nWhat is simply part 
 of being a teenager—and when does it warrant a closer look? Join us for 
 an expert-led ’Quin Chat exploring the mental health and well-being of t
 oday’s teenagers and how parents can better understand and support them 
 through these formative years. At a time marked by significant physical\, 
 emotional\, and social change - and amplified by social media\, constant c
 onnectivity\, academic pressures\, and an increasingly digital world - our
  panel will explore what constitutes typical teenage behavior\, signs that
  may warrant greater attention\, and how parents can approach difficult co
 nversations and offer meaningful support.\n\nModerated by Kimberlyn Leary\
 , PhD\, MPA\, associate professor of psychology at the Harvard Medical Sch
 ool and Senior Advisor at McLean Hospital\, the conversation will bring to
 gether adolescent mental health and pediatric experts Cecil Webster\, MD\,
  psychiatrist\, psychoanalyst\, and CEO of Webster Clinic\; Jacqueline Buc
 hanan\, MD\, psychiatrist at Webster Clinic\; and Essential Pediatrics Co-
 Founders Brenda Anders Pring\, MD\, and Christina Nordt\, MD. Together\, t
 hey will offer expert perspective on changing moods\, growing independence
 \, anxiety\, social pressures\, technology\, and the evolving parent-teen 
 relationship—with practical guidance for helping teenagers navigate it a
 ll.\n\n*This event is complimentary and reserved for members only. Complim
 entary light bites and refreshments will be served. We kindly ask that all
  cancellations be made at least 24 hours prior to the start of the event.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/206905
CATEGORIES:Health & Wellness
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:quin-event-206907@thequinhouse.com
