SUMMARY:Hands On Impact: Cradles to Crayons
LOCATION:Offsite - The Giving Factory
DESCRIPTION:Category: ‘Quin Impact Fund\nPrice: Free\nStatus: Waitlist On
 ly\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/195628\n\nMake an i
 mpact with Cradles to Crayons through a hands-on volunteer opportunity. Cr
 adles to Crayons is a nonprofit committed to ending children’s clothing 
 insecurity in the U.S. Since 2002\, they have provided more than 6 million
  packages of essentials - including clothing\, shoes\, diapers\, and schoo
 l supplies - to children across the country.\n\nAt the Cradles to Crayons 
 “Giving Factory\,” you will take part in sorting\, quality-checking\, 
 and packaging donations that go directly to children and families in need 
 - helping ensure every child can arrive at school feeling confident\, prep
 ared\, and valued.\n\n*This event is complimentary and reserved for member
 s\, plus one registered guest age 6+. Please wear comfortable clothing you
  don’t mind getting dirty\, along with close-toed shoes. The warehouse i
 s not climate controlled\, so dress with the weather in mind.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/195628
CATEGORIES:‘Quin Impact Fund
