SUMMARY:Black Widow: Web of Deceit | Friday Night
LOCATION:217 Commonwealth Mansion
DESCRIPTION:Category: Holiday\nPrice: $295.00 per person\nStatus: Waitlist 
 Only\nTime: 8 PM – 1 AM\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/eve
 nts/202982\n\nSlip into the camouflage of costume for an evening under the
  ethereal shadows of lacy silk couture…\n\nYou're cordially invited to T
 he ‘Quin’s Annual Halloween Soirée an elegant and entangled ticketed 
 affair. \n\nUnder the flicker of flame\, the ‘House will captivate with
  indulgent buffets\, enchanting performances\, and the deceivingly translu
 cent jeweled veil - of the spider’s web.\n\nEnsnared? Fall victim.\n\nI
 n the shadowed corners of the ‘House\, become entangled in buffets of cu
 linary bites\, live-action stations\, passed delicacies\, and venomous coc
 ktails. A dangerous game of hide-and-seek\, spiral the Grand Staircase lur
 ed by live musical performances\, shadowed portraitists\, acrobats\, and o
 ther-worldly talents...\n\nPerilous vibes take center stage in \n\nBondo�
 �\n\nwith a Headline DJ Performance from \n\n10:00PM - Midnight\n\nIn the
  spirit of Halloween\, swarm the ‘House.\n\nCreative black tie\, cocktai
 l attire\, or a cleverly crafted costume is essential.  \n\nTickets are e
 xclusively available for purchase through the Member App & Portal beginnin
 g September 16th at 10:00AM. Tickets for members and their guests are $295
 * each. To best accommodate members' varying preferences\, we are delight
 ed to extend a limited allocation of up to 3 guest tickets per member for 
 Friday evening's affair.\n\n* Beverages are not included in the ticket pri
 ce. Beverages will be available for purchase through our masterful team of
  mixologists. \n\n______________________________________________________\
 n\nPlease be aware of these important notices:\n\nCANCELLATION POLICY\n Ki
 ndly note that tickets are non-refundable and nontransferable once assigne
 d.\n\nENTRY\n All Member and guest tickets purchased\, are linked to the M
 ember’s profile through the App and Portal and are required for verifica
 tion and entry on these evenings.\n\nGUEST POLICY\n Following the regular 
 Member Policy\, Members must arrive and remain with their guest(s) at all 
 times. Guests must be age 21+. We strongly encourage review of the Members
 ’ Policy to ensure that you and your guest(s) are aware of Club rules.\n
 \nVALET SERVICES\n Valet services will be suspended on the evenings of Oct
 ober 23 & 24. Please plan ahead to secure rideshare services or park at th
 e nearest garage in Back Bay. Metered street parking is limited but also a
 vailable.\n\nNO PHOTO POLICY\n Please be aware that we will offer a photo 
 opportunity on these evenings\; however\, the regular Photo Policy will ot
