UID:quin-event-202989@thequinhouse.com
DTSTAMP:20261024T200000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261024
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261026
SUMMARY:Black Widow: Web of Deceit | Saturday Night
LOCATION:217 Commonwealth Mansion
DESCRIPTION:Category: Holiday\nPrice: $295.00 per person\nStatus: You are C
 onfirmed\nTime: 8 PM – 1 AM\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com
 /events/202989\n\nSlip into the camouflage of costume for an evening under
  the ethereal shadows of lacy silk couture…\n\nYou're cordially invited 
 to The ‘Quin’s Annual Halloween Soirée an elegant and entangled tick
 eted affair. \n\nUnder the flicker of flame\, the ‘House will captivate
  with indulgent buffets\, enchanting performances\, and the deceivingly t
 ranslucent jeweled veil - of the spider’s web.\n\nEnsnared? Fall victi
 m.\n\nIn the shadowed corners of the ‘House\, become entangled in buffet
 s of culinary bites\, live-action stations\, passed delicacies\, and venom
 ous cocktails. A dangerous game of hide-and-seek\, spiral the Grand Stairc
 ase lured by live musical performances\, shadowed portraitists\, acrobats\
 , and other-worldly talents...\n\nPerilous vibes take center stage in \n\
 nBondo \n\nwith a Headline DJ Performance from \n\n10:00PM - Midnight\n\
 nIn the spirit of Halloween\, swarm the ‘House.\n\nCreative black tie\, 
 cocktail attire\, or a cleverly crafted costume is essential.  \n\nTicket
 s are exclusively available for purchase through the Member App & Portal b
 eginning September 16th at 10:00AM. Tickets for members and their guests a
 re $295* each. To best accommodate members' varying preferences\, we are 
 delighted to extend a limited allocation of up to 1 guest ticket per membe
 r for Saturday evening's affair.\n\n*Beverages are not included in the ti
 cket price. Beverages will be available for purchase through our masterful
  team of mixologists. \n\n_______________________________________________
 _______\n\nPlease be aware of these important notices:\n\nCANCELLATION POL
 ICY\nKindly note that tickets are non-refundable and nontransferable once 
 assigned.\n\nENTRY\nAll Member and guest tickets purchased\, are linked to
  the Member’s profile through the App and Portal and are required for ve
 rification and entry on these evenings.\n\nGUEST POLICY\nFollowing the reg
 ular Member Policy\, Members must arrive and remain with their guest(s) at
  all times. Guests must be age 21+. We strongly encourage review of the Me
 mbers’ Policy to ensure that you and your guest(s) are aware of Club rul
 es.\n\nVALET SERVICES\nValet services will be suspended on the evenings of
  October 23 & 24. Please plan ahead to secure rideshare services or park a
 t the nearest garage in Back Bay. Metered street parking is limited but al
 so available.\n\nNO PHOTO POLICY\nPlease be aware that we will offer a pho
 to opportunity on these evenings\; however\, the regular Photo Policy will
  otherwise be in effect and enforced. Those who do not comply with the Pri
 vacy Agreement will be asked to leave the Clubhouse in keeping with the st
 andards.\n\nThe ’Quin House has contracted professional photographers an
 d videographers to capture this event. Any photos or videos distributed th
 rough ’Quin public channels will be edited to conceal the identities of 
 participating Members and their guest(s). Photos or videos that reveal Mem
 bers will only be used in Member communication with the authorization of t
 hose captured.\n\nQuestions? Please contact us at halloween@thequin.com.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/202989
CATEGORIES:Holiday
END:VEVENT
