 \nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/207548\n\nYou have a 
 match. Now comes the fun part: finding them.\n\nAt our next Member Mixer\,
  a clue awaits you on arrival. Follow it through the room to find your mys
 tery match\, then discover where the conversation takes you. You might unc
 over a shared interest\, an unexpected connection\, or simply someone you 
 are glad to have met. It’s a playful way to step outside your usual circ
 le and meet someone new. Come curious\, leave connected!\n\n*This event is
  complimentary and reserved for members only. Complimentary light bites wi
 ll be served with beverages will be available to purchase. We kindly ask t
 hat all cancellations be made at least 24 hours prior to the start of the 
 event.
