 A
DESCRIPTION:Category: ‘Quin Impact Fund\nPrice: Free\nAvailability: 12 sp
 ots left\nStatus: Available\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/e
 vents/208337\n\nJoin The ’Quin Impact Fund for a hands-on volunteer expe
 rience at the Greater Boston Food Bank\, where members can make a tangible
  difference in the fight against hunger across our community. Participants
  will help sort\, package\, and organize food donations that support thous
 ands of neighbors in need throughout Greater Boston.\n\nThe Greater Boston
  Food Bank (GBFB)\, New England’s largest hunger-relief organization and
  a member of Feeding America\, distributed 107 million pounds of nutritiou
 s food last year alone. Through the dedication of its staff\, volunteers\,
  and partners\, GBFB works to provide three meals a day to every person in
  need in Eastern Massachusetts\, supporting healthy lives and thriving com
 munities.\n\n*This event is complimentary and reserved for members only. P
 lease wear comfortable clothing suitable for service and close-toed shoes.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/208337
CATEGORIES:‘Quin Impact Fund
